    "Measured on the preview's raw CCD values, before any correction. Left: the noise floor; right: clipping. Provisional thresholds, to be measured on the X1.": {
      "comment": "Tooltip of the exposure gauge",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
