    "Sizes in pixels; millimetres once the preview resolution is confirmed. Input: the scanner's pixels under the frame. Output: the file Export writes, turned, straightened and cropped. Resolution and scale apply to the scan in a later step.": {
      "comment": "Tooltip and VoiceOver hint of the Input and Output size rows of the settings panel",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sizes in pixels; millimetres once the preview resolution is confirmed. Input: the scanner's pixels under the frame. Output: the file Export writes, turned, straightened and cropped. Resolution and scale apply to the scan in a later step."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tailles en pixels ; en millimètres quand la résolution de l'aperçu sera confirmée. Entrée : les pixels du scanner sous le cadre. Sortie : le fichier qu'écrit Exporter, tourné, redressé et recadré. Résolution et échelle s'appliqueront au scan dans une étape ultérieure."
          }
        }
      }
    },
